# --- Data ---
# The small derived artifacts the application needs at runtime (the FAISS index,
# the filtered metadata, and the transcripts) are committed, so the repo can be
# built and deployed straight from a clone. Bulk raw inputs are not: the arXiv
# snapshot is several gigabytes and is fetched separately when rebuilding.
data/01_raw/*.json
data/01_raw/kaggle_arxiv/
data/**/*.csv

# --- Personal notes ---
# Deployment walkthrough kept for personal reference. It records project ids,
# service URLs and account details, so it stays out of the public repository.
NOTES-gcp-deployment.md

